{'symbol': 'ROL', 'date': '2021-10-27 07:30:00', 'title': 'ROLLINS, INC. REPORTS THIRD QUARTER AND NINE MONTH 2021 FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': "ATLANTA, OCT. 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ROLLINS, INC. (NYSE:ROL), A PREMIER GLOBAL CONSUMER AND COMMERCIAL SERVICES COMPANY, REPORTED STRONG UNAUDITED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR ITS THIRD QUARTER AND NINE MONTHS ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2021. THE COMPANY RECORDED THIRD QUARTER REVENUES OF $650.2 MILLION, AN INCREASE OF 11.4% OVER THE PRIOR YEAR'S THIRD QUARTER REVENUE OF $583.7 MILLION."}